{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-markdown-remark-js","path":"/users/apps/docs/argocd/import_dev_gpg.md","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Operate First"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"35a32f8f-1a20-51c4-bc75-811ad7f37b29","html":"<h2 id=\"import-development-gpg-key\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#import-development-gpg-key\" aria-label=\"import development gpg key permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Import Development GPG Key</h2>\n<p>If you would like to import the GPG key used for dev purposes in our ArgoCD dev deployment, you can find it under: <code class=\"language-text\">apps/docs/argocd/key.asc</code>. To import it simply run:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">$ base64 -d &lt; apps/docs/argocd/key.asc | gpg --import</code></pre></div>\n<p>You will need to import this key to be able to decrypt the contents of the secrets using sops.</p>\n<p>Do NOT use this gpg key for prod purposes.</p>","fields":{"srcLink":"https://github.com/operate-first/apps/blob/master/docs/argocd/import_dev_gpg.md"},"frontmatter":{"title":"","description":null,"extraClasses":null,"banner":null}}},"pageContext":{"id":"35a32f8f-1a20-51c4-bc75-811ad7f37b29"}},"staticQueryHashes":["117426894","3000541721","3606484676","533861647"]}